# One proxy IP per line. Rename this file to proxies.txt (or point PROXY_LIST_FILE at it).
# Port, username and password come from .env (PROXY_LIST_PORT / PROXY_LIST_USERNAME / PROXY_LIST_PASSWORD).
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
